  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - On account of its design and excessive size, the proposed development would result in an obtrusive development and fail to remain subservient to the main house, causing harm to its character and visual appearance, and that of the existing streetscene and surrounding area. This would be contrary to policies CC1 (Context and Character), SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) of the adopted Local Plan (2015) and the intentions of the adopted Residential Extension Guidelines SPD",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed single storey rear extension, due to its excessive depth would be considered harmful to the living conditions of the attached neighbour. This would be contrary to policies CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) of the adopted Local Plan (2015) and the intentions of the adopted Residential Extension Guidelines SPD"
